# Channel Talk

> AI agent platform for automated customer support

Channel Talk is an all-in-one AI messenger that automatically resolves customer inquiries with AI and unifies customer support, marketing, and team communication in one place. Used across 229,098+ active channels worldwide, including Eastarjet, Daewoong Pharmaceutical, Eland Eats, Skinfood, Verish, Coloso, and Amuse.

## Features

- **ALF** — AI agent for customer support. Handles everything from repetitive FAQs to order cancellations, returns, and address changes autonomously. Adopted by 3,000+ businesses with an average AI resolution rate of 65%.
- **Team ALF** — AI agent for internal work. Consolidates scattered internal knowledge in Documents and answers questions like an in-house ChatGPT.
- **Live Chat** — Unified inbox that integrates and manages all customer conversations from KakaoTalk, Naver TalkTalk, email, and more in one place.
- **Meet** — Quick phone number setup with flexible IVR configuration, automatic STT transcription, and AI call summaries.
- **Voice ALF** — ALF handles incoming customer calls directly, answering FAQs or routing to chat ALF to automate customer inquiries end-to-end.
- **Team Chat** — Internal team messenger with built-in AI.
- **Workflow** — No-code automation tool for designing and editing scenario-based chatbots.
- **Documents** — Knowledge management tool for creating and managing documents that ALF references, with easy web publishing to create a help center or blog.
- **Marketing** — CRM marketing tool that consolidates customer data including support history, order info, and visit count, with SMS, email, and KakaoTalk broadcast capabilities.

